{"level":10,"root_class":"mon-stat-block","segments":[{"element":"a","class":"mon-stat-block__name-link","text":"Tarrasque"},{"element":"div","class":"mon-stat-block__meta","text":"Gargantuan Monstrosity (Titan), Unaligned"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__attribute-label","text":"Armor Class"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__attribute-data-value","text":"25"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__attribute-data-extra","text":"(natural armor)"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__attribute-label","text":"Hit Points"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__attribute-data-value","text":"676"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__attribute-data-extra","text":"(33d20 + 330)"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__attribute-label","text":"Speed"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__attribute-data-value","text":"40 ft."},{"element":"div","class":"ability-block__heading","text":"STR"},{"element":"span","class":"ability-block__score","text":"30"},{"element":"span","class":"ability-block__modifier","text":"(+10)"},{"element":"div","class":"ability-block__heading","text":"DEX"},{"element":"span","class":"ability-block__score","text":"11"},{"element":"span","class":"ability-block__modifier","text":"(+0)"},{"element":"div","class":"ability-block__heading","text":"CON"},{"element":"span","class":"ability-block__score","text":"30"},{"element":"span","class":"ability-block__modifier","text":"(+10)"},{"element":"div","class":"ability-block__heading","text":"INT"},{"element":"span","class":"ability-block__score","text":"3"},{"element":"span","class":"ability-block__modifier","text":"(-4)"},{"element":"div","class":"ability-block__heading","text":"WIS"},{"element":"span","class":"ability-block__score","text":"11"},{"element":"span","class":"ability-block__modifier","text":"(+0)"},{"element":"div","class":"ability-block__heading","text":"CHA"},{"element":"span","class":"ability-block__score","text":"11"},{"element":"span","class":"ability-block__modifier","text":"(+0)"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-label","text":"Saving Throws"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-data","text":"INT +5, WIS +9, CHA +9"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-label","text":"Damage Immunities"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-data","text":"Fire, Poison; Bludgeoning, Piercing, and Slashing from Nonmagical Attacks"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-label","text":"Condition Immunities"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"Charmed"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-data","text":","},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"Frightened"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-data","text":","},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"Paralyzed"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-data","text":","},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"Poisoned"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-label","text":"Senses"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover sense-tooltip","text":"Blindsight"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-data","text":"120 ft.,  Passive Perception 10"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-label","text":"Languages"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-data","text":"--"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-label","text":"Challenge"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-data","text":"30 (155,000 XP)"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-label","text":"Proficiency Bonus"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-data","text":"+9"},{"element":"div","class":"mon-stat-block__description-block-heading","text":"Traits"},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Legendary Resistance (3/Day)."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"If the tarrasque fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Magic Resistance."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The tarrasque has advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Reflective Carapace."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"Any time the tarrasque is targeted by a"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover spell-tooltip","text":"magic missile"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"spell, a line spell, or a spell that requires a ranged attack roll, roll a"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"d6"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":". On a 1 to 5, the tarrasque is unaffected. On a 6, the tarrasque is unaffected, and the effect is reflected back at the caster as though it originated from the tarrasque, turning the caster into the target."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Siege Monster."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The tarrasque deals double damage to objects and structures."},{"element":"div","class":"mon-stat-block__description-block-heading","text":"Actions"},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Multiattack."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The tarrasque can use its Frightful Presence. It then makes five attacks: one with its bite, two with its claws, one with its horns, and one with its tail. It can use its Swallow instead of its bite."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Bite."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Melee Weapon Attack:"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"+19"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"to hit, reach 10 ft., one target."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Hit:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"36"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(4d12 + 10)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"piercing damage. If the target is a creature, it is"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"grappled"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"(escape DC 20). Until this grapple ends, the target is"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"restrained"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":", and the tarrasque can’t bite another target."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Claw."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Melee Weapon Attack:"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"+19"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"to hit, reach 15ft., one target."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Hit:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"28"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(4d8 + 10)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"slashing damage."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Horns."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Melee Weapon Attack:"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"+19"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"to hit, reach 10ft., one target."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Hit:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"32"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(4d10 + 10)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"piercing damage."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Tail."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Melee Weapon Attack:"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"+19"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"to hit, reach 20ft., one target."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Hit:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"24"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(4d6 + 10)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"bludgeoning damage. If the target is a creature, it must succeed on a DC 20 Strength saving throw or be knocked"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"prone"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Frightful Presence."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"Each creature of the tarrasque’s choice within 120 feet of it and aware of it must succeed on a DC 17 Wisdom saving throw or become"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"frightened"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"for 1 minute. A creature can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, with disadvantage if the tarrasque is within line of sight, ending the effect on itself on a success. If a creature’s saving throw is successful or the effect ends for it, the creature is immune to the tarrasque’s Frightful Presence for the next 24 hours."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Swallow."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The tarrasque makes one bite attack against a Large or smaller creature it is grappling. If the attack hits, the target takes the bite’s damage, the target is swallowed, and the grapple ends. While swallowed, the creature is"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"blinded"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"and"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"restrained"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":", it has total cover against attacks and other effects outside the tarrasque, and it takes 56"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(16d6)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"acid damage at the start of each of the tarrasque’s turns."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"If the tarrasque takes 60 damage or more on a single turn from a creature inside it, the tarrasque must succeed on a DC 20 Constitution saving throw at the end of that turn or regurgitate all swallowed creatures, which fall"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"prone"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"in a space within 10 feet of the tarrasque. If the tarrasque dies, a swallowed creature is no longer"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"restrained"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"by it and can escape from the corpse by using 30 feet of movement, exiting"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"prone"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"."},{"element":"div","class":"mon-stat-block__description-block-heading","text":"Legendary Actions"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The tarrasque can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature’s turn. The tarrasque regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Attack."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The tarrasque makes one claw attack or tail attack."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Move."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The tarrasque moves up to half its speed."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Chomp (Costs 2 Actions)."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The tarrasque makes one bite attack or uses its Swallow."}],"tags":164,"max_dom_depth":7}